// Parliamentary Procedure lessons 6–10: postponing, referring and tabling; privileged and incidental motions;
// changing the group's mind with voting and elections; bylaws, officers and committees; and the Round Two meeting.
const RULES=['HOSA Parliamentary Procedure 2026–27 guidelines and rating sheet','https://hosa.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Parli-Pro-26-27.pdf'];
const RONR=['Robert’s Rules of Order: official website','https://robertsrules.com/'];
